Package: linux-image-7.2.0-5-sl7
Version: 7.2.0-5.5+sl7.1
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Local Surface Support <root@localhost>
Depends: kmod, dracut-core, grub-efi-arm64-signed, shim-signed, mokutil, sbsigntool, iptsd (>= 3.1.0+sl7.1)
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Description: Ubuntu kernel with Surface Laptop 7 Wi-Fi and QSPI touchpad support
 Built from Ubuntu linux 7.2.0-5.5 with a scoped ath12k rfkill workaround,
 QSPI/GPI/HID-SPI support, and the Romulus13 touchpad device tree.
 Uses signed modules and a separately signed Stubble kernel image.
 Installs a separate boot entry and preserves the normal Ubuntu default.
